    "result_text": "The only test class with tests is `AcceptanceTest` (the other 2 files are `AcceptanceBase` and a support class), and the full `mvnw test` run reported **BUILD SUCCESS** with all tests green.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented `contactPreference` on the Owner response: `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`.\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema (so the generated `OwnerDto` gets the field).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `contactPreference` backed by a `contactPreference(Owner)` helper that returns `\"EMAIL\"` when `owner.getEmail()` is non-null and non-blank, else `\"PHONE\"`. This mirrors the existing email-presence check used by `membershipLevel`.\n\nThe endpoint's `RespondWithOwner` function already maps via `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`, so no pipeline/YAML changes were needed. Both acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) pass, and the full build is green.",
